WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.541
A correlated query becomes easier if you trace one
outer row at a time Imagine

00:00:06.567 --> 00:00:12.188
the current row is a Glucose test The inner query
uses the outer test

00:00:12.201 --> 00:00:18.113
name to average only Glucose values Then the current
result is compared

00:00:18.126 --> 00:00:23.665
with that benchmark When the outer row changes to
another test the inner

00:00:23.692 --> 00:00:25.244
benchmark changes as well
